{"max-visible-options":"<div class=\"grid gap-x-10 gap-y-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Max Visible Options</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">MaxVisibleOptions caps the visible option rows and scrolls the rest.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/form/inlineRadioGroup.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiForm.InlineRadioGroup(uiForm.InlineRadioGroupSettings{\n\tLabel:             &#34;Planet&#34;,\n\tOrientation:       uiForm.InlineRadioGroupOrientationVertical,\n\tMaxVisibleOptions: 3,\n\tInputSettings: []uiForm.RadioInputSettings{\n\t\t{Label: &#34;Mercury&#34;, StateValue: &#34;mercury&#34;, TwoWayStatePath: &#34;planetSelection&#34;},\n\t\t{Label: &#34;Venus&#34;, StateValue: &#34;venus&#34;, TwoWayStatePath: &#34;planetSelection&#34;},\n\t\t{Label: &#34;Earth&#34;, StateValue: &#34;earth&#34;, TwoWayStatePath: &#34;planetSelection&#34;},\n\t},\n\tTwoWayStatePath: &#34;planetSelection&#34;,\n})</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Live Example</p><div x-data=\"{planetSelection: 'earth'}\" class=\"flex w-full max-w-50 flex-col gap-3\"><!-- InlineRadioGroup --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col\"><fieldset class=\"bg-neutral-50/7.5 relative -mt-1.5 w-full rounded border border-neutral-50/5 transition-colors focus-within:border-neutral-50/30 hover:border-neutral-50/30\"><legend class=\"ml-1 select-none px-1 text-xs font-bold leading-none text-neutral-50/80 \">Planet</legend> <div class=\"flex min-h-8 flex-col items-start gap-2 p-1.5 overflow-y-auto\" style=\"max-height: 5.25rem;\"><!-- RadioInput --><div class=\"hover:text-secondary-500 inline-flex items-center text-neutral-100\" @click=\"planetSelection = &#34;mercury&#34;\"><label class=\"flex flex-row select-none gap-1 cursor-pointer items-center text-sm \" :class=\"String(planetSelection) == &#34;mercury&#34; &amp;&amp; &#34;text-secondary-500 font-bold&#34;\"><input type=\"radio\" value=\"mercury\" x-model=\"planetSelection\" class=\"peer sr-only\"><i class=\"ph-duotone rounded-full peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500 text-xl\" :class=\"String(planetSelection) == &#34;mercury&#34; ? &#34;ph-check-circle&#34; : &#34;ph-circle&#34;\"></i>Mercury</label></div><!-- RadioInput --><div class=\"hover:text-secondary-500 inline-flex items-center text-neutral-100\" @click=\"planetSelection = &#34;venus&#34;\"><label class=\"flex flex-row select-none gap-1 cursor-pointer items-center text-sm \" :class=\"String(planetSelection) == &#34;venus&#34; &amp;&amp; &#34;text-secondary-500 font-bold&#34;\"><input type=\"radio\" value=\"venus\" x-model=\"planetSelection\" class=\"peer sr-only\"><i class=\"ph-duotone rounded-full peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500 text-xl\" :class=\"String(planetSelection) == &#34;venus&#34; ? &#34;ph-check-circle&#34; : &#34;ph-circle&#34;\"></i>Venus</label></div><!-- RadioInput --><div class=\"hover:text-secondary-500 inline-flex items-center text-neutral-100\" @click=\"planetSelection = &#34;earth&#34;\"><label class=\"flex flex-row select-none gap-1 cursor-pointer items-center text-sm \" :class=\"String(planetSelection) == &#34;earth&#34; &amp;&amp; &#34;text-secondary-500 font-bold&#34;\"><input type=\"radio\" value=\"earth\" x-model=\"planetSelection\" class=\"peer sr-only\"><i class=\"ph-duotone rounded-full peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500 text-xl\" :class=\"String(planetSelection) == &#34;earth&#34; ? &#34;ph-check-circle&#34; : &#34;ph-circle&#34;\"></i>Earth</label></div><!-- RadioInput --><div class=\"hover:text-secondary-500 inline-flex items-center text-neutral-100\" @click=\"planetSelection = &#34;mars&#34;\"><label class=\"flex flex-row select-none gap-1 cursor-pointer items-center text-sm \" :class=\"String(planetSelection) == &#34;mars&#34; &amp;&amp; &#34;text-secondary-500 font-bold&#34;\"><input type=\"radio\" value=\"mars\" x-model=\"planetSelection\" class=\"peer sr-only\"><i class=\"ph-duotone rounded-full peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500 text-xl\" :class=\"String(planetSelection) == &#34;mars&#34; ? &#34;ph-check-circle&#34; : &#34;ph-circle&#34;\"></i>Mars</label></div><!-- RadioInput --><div class=\"hover:text-secondary-500 inline-flex items-center text-neutral-100\" @click=\"planetSelection = &#34;jupiter&#34;\"><label class=\"flex flex-row select-none gap-1 cursor-pointer items-center text-sm \" :class=\"String(planetSelection) == &#34;jupiter&#34; &amp;&amp; &#34;text-secondary-500 font-bold&#34;\"><input type=\"radio\" value=\"jupiter\" x-model=\"planetSelection\" class=\"peer sr-only\"><i class=\"ph-duotone rounded-full peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500 text-xl\" :class=\"String(planetSelection) == &#34;jupiter&#34; ? &#34;ph-check-circle&#34; : &#34;ph-circle&#34;\"></i>Jupiter</label></div><!-- RadioInput --><div class=\"hover:text-secondary-500 inline-flex items-center text-neutral-100\" @click=\"planetSelection = &#34;saturn&#34;\"><label class=\"flex flex-row select-none gap-1 cursor-pointer items-center text-sm \" :class=\"String(planetSelection) == &#34;saturn&#34; &amp;&amp; &#34;text-secondary-500 font-bold&#34;\"><input type=\"radio\" value=\"saturn\" x-model=\"planetSelection\" class=\"peer sr-only\"><i class=\"ph-duotone rounded-full peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500 text-xl\" :class=\"String(planetSelection) == &#34;saturn&#34; ? &#34;ph-check-circle&#34; : &#34;ph-circle&#34;\"></i>Saturn</label></div></div></fieldset></div><p class=\"mt-1.5 rounded-md border border-amber-400/30 bg-amber-400/10 p-3 font-mono text-xs text-amber-100 [text-box:trim-both_cap_alphabetic]\">Value: <span x-text=\"planetSelection\"></span></p></div></div></div>","sizes":"<div class=\"grid gap-x-10 gap-y-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Sizes</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">Each radio carries its own Size, so the group can scale per option. TextCase transforms the legend and the labels, and InputName includes the selected value in form submission.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/form/inlineRadioGroup.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiForm.InlineRadioGroup(uiForm.InlineRadioGroupSettings{\n\tLabel: &#34;Select an option&#34;,\n\tInputSettings: []uiForm.RadioInputSettings{\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tLabel:           &#34;Option 1&#34;,\n\t\t\tStateValue:      &#34;option1&#34;,\n\t\t\tTwoWayStatePath: &#34;groupSizeSelection&#34;,\n\t\t\tInputId:         &#34;groupOption1&#34;,\n\t\t\tInputName:       &#34;groupSizes&#34;,\n\t\t\tSize:            uiForm.RadioInputSizeSm,\n\t\t\tTextCase:        uiToolset.TextCaseUpper,\n\t\t},\n\t},\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tTwoWayStatePath: &#34;groupSizeSelection&#34;,\n\tInputName:       &#34;groupSizeSelection&#34;,\n\tTextCase:        uiToolset.TextCaseUpper,\n})</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Live Example</p><div x-data=\"{groupSizeSelection: 'md'}\" class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><!-- InlineRadioGroup --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col\"><fieldset class=\"bg-neutral-50/7.5 relative -mt-1.5 w-full rounded border border-neutral-50/5 transition-colors focus-within:border-neutral-50/30 hover:border-neutral-50/30\"><legend class=\"ml-1 select-none px-1 text-xs font-bold leading-none text-neutral-50/80 uppercase\">Pick a size</legend> <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"groupSizeSelection\" x-model:value=\"groupSizeSelection\"><div class=\"flex min-h-8 flex-row items-center gap-2 p-1.5\"><!-- RadioInput --><div class=\"hover:text-secondary-500 inline-flex items-center text-neutral-100\" @click=\"groupSizeSelection = &#34;sm&#34;\"><label class=\"flex flex-row select-none gap-1 cursor-pointer items-center text-sm uppercase\" :class=\"String(groupSizeSelection) == &#34;sm&#34; &amp;&amp; &#34;text-secondary-500 font-bold&#34;\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"groupSizeSm\" name=\"groupSizes\" value=\"sm\" x-model=\"groupSizeSelection\" class=\"peer sr-only\"><i class=\"ph-duotone rounded-full peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500 text-xl\" :class=\"String(groupSizeSelection) == &#34;sm&#34; ? &#34;ph-check-circle&#34; : &#34;ph-circle&#34;\"></i>Small</label></div><!-- RadioInput --><div class=\"hover:text-secondary-500 inline-flex items-center text-neutral-100\" @click=\"groupSizeSelection = &#34;md&#34;\"><label class=\"flex flex-row select-none gap-1 cursor-pointer items-center text-base uppercase\" :class=\"String(groupSizeSelection) == &#34;md&#34; &amp;&amp; &#34;text-secondary-500 font-bold&#34;\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"groupSizeMd\" name=\"groupSizes\" value=\"md\" x-model=\"groupSizeSelection\" class=\"peer sr-only\"><i class=\"ph-duotone rounded-full peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500 text-2xl\" :class=\"String(groupSizeSelection) == &#34;md&#34; ? &#34;ph-check-circle&#34; : &#34;ph-circle&#34;\"></i>Medium</label></div><!-- RadioInput --><div class=\"hover:text-secondary-500 inline-flex items-center text-neutral-100\" @click=\"groupSizeSelection = &#34;lg&#34;\"><label class=\"flex flex-row select-none gap-1 cursor-pointer items-center text-lg uppercase\" :class=\"String(groupSizeSelection) == &#34;lg&#34; &amp;&amp; &#34;text-secondary-500 font-bold&#34;\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"groupSizeLg\" name=\"groupSizes\" value=\"lg\" x-model=\"groupSizeSelection\" class=\"peer sr-only\"><i class=\"ph-duotone rounded-full peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500 text-3xl\" :class=\"String(groupSizeSelection) == &#34;lg&#34; ? &#34;ph-check-circle&#34; : &#34;ph-circle&#34;\"></i>Large</label></div></div></fieldset></div></div></div></div>","vertical-orientation":"<div class=\"grid gap-x-10 gap-y-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Vertical Orientation</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">Orientation stacks the options in one column instead of one row.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/form/inlineRadioGroup.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiForm.InlineRadioGroup(uiForm.InlineRadioGroupSettings{\n\tLabel:       &#34;Select an option&#34;,\n\tOrientation: uiForm.InlineRadioGroupOrientationVertical,\n\tInputSettings: []uiForm.RadioInputSettings{\n\t\t{Label: &#34;Option 1&#34;, StateValue: &#34;option1&#34;, TwoWayStatePath: &#34;groupVerticalSelection&#34;},\n\t\t{Label: &#34;Option 2&#34;, StateValue: &#34;option2&#34;, TwoWayStatePath: &#34;groupVerticalSelection&#34;},\n\t\t{Label: &#34;Option 3&#34;, StateValue: &#34;option3&#34;, TwoWayStatePath: &#34;groupVerticalSelection&#34;},\n\t},\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tTwoWayStatePath: &#34;groupVerticalSelection&#34;,\n})</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Live Example</p><div x-data=\"{groupVerticalSelection: 'option2'}\" class=\"flex w-full max-w-50 flex-col gap-3\"><!-- InlineRadioGroup --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col\"><fieldset class=\"bg-neutral-50/7.5 relative -mt-1.5 w-full rounded border border-neutral-50/5 transition-colors focus-within:border-neutral-50/30 hover:border-neutral-50/30\"><legend class=\"ml-1 select-none px-1 text-xs font-bold leading-none text-neutral-50/80 \">Select an option</legend> <div class=\"flex min-h-8 flex-col items-start gap-2 p-1.5\"><!-- RadioInput --><div class=\"hover:text-secondary-500 inline-flex items-center text-neutral-100\" @click=\"groupVerticalSelection = &#34;option1&#34;\"><label class=\"flex flex-row select-none gap-1 cursor-pointer items-center text-sm \" :class=\"String(groupVerticalSelection) == &#34;option1&#34; &amp;&amp; &#34;text-secondary-500 font-bold&#34;\"><input type=\"radio\" value=\"option1\" x-model=\"groupVerticalSelection\" class=\"peer sr-only\"><i class=\"ph-duotone rounded-full peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500 text-xl\" :class=\"String(groupVerticalSelection) == &#34;option1&#34; ? &#34;ph-check-circle&#34; : &#34;ph-circle&#34;\"></i>Option 1</label></div><!-- RadioInput --><div class=\"hover:text-secondary-500 inline-flex items-center text-neutral-100\" @click=\"groupVerticalSelection = &#34;option2&#34;\"><label class=\"flex flex-row select-none gap-1 cursor-pointer items-center text-sm \" :class=\"String(groupVerticalSelection) == &#34;option2&#34; &amp;&amp; &#34;text-secondary-500 font-bold&#34;\"><input type=\"radio\" value=\"option2\" x-model=\"groupVerticalSelection\" class=\"peer sr-only\"><i class=\"ph-duotone rounded-full peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500 text-xl\" :class=\"String(groupVerticalSelection) == &#34;option2&#34; ? &#34;ph-check-circle&#34; : &#34;ph-circle&#34;\"></i>Option 2</label></div><!-- RadioInput --><div class=\"hover:text-secondary-500 inline-flex items-center text-neutral-100\" @click=\"groupVerticalSelection = &#34;option3&#34;\"><label class=\"flex flex-row select-none gap-1 cursor-pointer items-center text-sm \" :class=\"String(groupVerticalSelection) == &#34;option3&#34; &amp;&amp; &#34;text-secondary-500 font-bold&#34;\"><input type=\"radio\" value=\"option3\" x-model=\"groupVerticalSelection\" class=\"peer sr-only\"><i class=\"ph-duotone rounded-full peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500 text-xl\" :class=\"String(groupVerticalSelection) == &#34;option3&#34; ? &#34;ph-check-circle&#34; : &#34;ph-circle&#34;\"></i>Option 3</label></div></div></fieldset></div><p class=\"mt-1.5 rounded-md border border-amber-400/30 bg-amber-400/10 p-3 font-mono text-xs text-amber-100 [text-box:trim-both_cap_alphabetic]\">Value: <span x-text=\"groupVerticalSelection\"></span></p></div></div></div>"}
